@startuml
title Host e caricatore durante il probe

participant Firmware
participant "Stack USB" as stack
participant "Estremità del cavo" as peer
participant Policy

Firmware -> Policy: VBUS confermata
Policy -> stack: avvia il probe
stack -> peer: presenta il device

alt host USB
  peer -> stack: bus reset
  peer -> stack: setup packet
  peer -> stack: SET_ADDRESS
  peer -> stack: SET_CONFIGURATION
  stack -> Policy: mount fresco
  Policy -> Policy: route = USB
else caricatore
  note over peer,stack: nessun traffico di controllo
  Policy -> Policy: timeout del probe
  Policy -> stack: rimuove la presentazione
  Policy -> Policy: route invariata
end
@enduml
